{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Infinite Nowhere</strong> is a cinematic first-person story of isolation, cosmic wonder, and the search for meaning. As Celes, a lone android aboard the derelict research ship Helios-R1, you must keep failing systems alive and race to decode fragments of the Helix Anomaly. What truth lies past reality?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/mission.png?t=1749221991\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repair oxygen leaks, restore failing power systems, and reestablish communication as the ship\u00a0(your home) lingers on the edge of disaster. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every failure pushes the crew closer to collapse, as the anomaly destabilizes reality itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/Infinite_Nowhere_Gif_02.gif?t=1749221991\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/story2.png?t=1749221991\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience a deeply emotional journey as Celes</strong>, forming fragile bonds with the crew through intimate, tension-filled conversations. As their trust unravels and reality fractures, your success becomes humanity\u2019s final hope.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Piece together</strong> their stories through logs, artifacts, and environmental clues that reveal the crew\u2019s collapse and humanity\u2019s fragile place in the universe.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/Infinite_Nowhere_Gif_01.gif?t=1749221991\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/cos4.png?t=1749221991\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explor</strong>e awe-inspiring cosmic wonders that defy the laws of physics. Confront mysteries that challenge your identity, distort reality, and question existence itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immerse yourself</strong> in an atmosphere of beauty and terror, where every discovery raises more questions than answers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/Infinite_Nowhere_Gif_03.gif?t=1749221991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/into2.png?t=1749221991\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy a drone to explore uncharted regions of space, investigate celestial phenomena, and uncover secrets hidden in the vast, unreachable corners of the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/Infinite_Nowhere_Gif_04.gif?t=1749221991\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201800/extras/Whislist_now.png?t=1749221991\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you hold the ship together  or watch reality tear itself apart?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist Infinite Nowhere now and prepare to question everything.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201800?t=1749221991","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201800?t=1749221991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st